# src/ React and theme

## Stack

- React **17**, TypeScript for `src/` (Docusaurus build does not rely on `tsc` for main output).
- Styling: global SCSS (`src/css/global.scss`) + CSS modules (`*.module.scss`) for pages/components.
- ESLint (Airbnb): `npm run lint` covers `src`, `i18n`, `docs`.

## Config access

Read site-specific values from `useDocusaurusContext().siteConfig.customFields` (merged from `web.config.js`): URLs, `currentLocale`, gallery URL, GitHub links, etc.

## Theme swizzles (`src/theme/`)

- `DocPaginator` → renders `null` (prev/next doc nav disabled site-wide).
- `NavbarNavLink` — custom active-class behavior.
- Color mode: default dark, **switch disabled** (single diagram theme set).

## Key components

- `APHCanvas.tsx` — browser-only bridge to examples bundle; guard with `typeof window !== 'undefined'`.
- `src/pages/` — home, gallery (links to external gallery), Czech videos catalog, Czech artifacts.
- `src/internals/` — gallery data, resources, custom Prism themes.

## Search plugin

Local fork at `plugins/docusaurus-search-local`. Lunr language includes `"ru"` as tokenizer stand-in for Czech — preserve that intent if touching search config.
